0..75 Comment "//! One ascription path for a module and a theory: a module is a model of a"
76..152 Comment "//! theory, `module M : Model(T)` ascribes it transparently and `module M :>"
153..230 Comment "//! Model(T)` seals it, the theory\'s sorts abstract outside. A theory with no"
231..306 Comment "//! laws is an ML signature; the same ascription checks a theory with laws,"
307..370 Comment "//! whose members are the module\'s proofs. After Kaposi and Xie"
371..464 Comment "//! [Kaposi-2024-secondorder_generalised_algebraic_theories_signatures_firstorder_semantics],"
465..542 Comment "//! whose first-order models are a theory\'s algebras, and Rossberg, Russo and"
543..616 Comment "//! Dreyer [Rossberg-2014-fing_modules] for sealing as opaque ascription."
617..620 Comment "//!"
621..636 Comment "//! - see: #746"
637..738 Comment "//! - cites: [Kaposi-2024-secondorder_generalised_algebraic_theories_signatures_firstorder_semantics]"
